Staged twin of the live assay-statusgen.yml adding the hourly board-reconcile job (derived-board/04): schedule trigger, read-only reconcile permissions, one draft PR on board/reconcile; and a PR lint step that runs that job's tests. Pending maintainer promotion; not active here. Also fences all App-token jobs with the main-only board-writer Environment. Also adds forgeread/** to both path filters and archives the sibling forgeread module into the corroboration guard's base build (statusgen replaces it by relative path). Also adds tools/desk/internal/arch/** to both path filters, since the architecture check reads the statusgen/evaluation owner (statusgen/15).
